        "TileImage": "$($repository 1a1049a8-62fe-4b91-ad84-0ba68e8e8663).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47,\rOur cautious client has discovered that her personal bodyguards are spreading bad news about her behind her back, and therefore hopes that we can issue a dismissal notice for her.However, the board of directors happened to discover that they were actually employed by competitors of ICA, lurking around our client to steal intelligence.It&apos;s time for them to retire early.\rI would leave you to prepare.",
